    {
      "gap": "Every note in a module shares the same two tags, so the validator's tag-overlap duplicate check reports every pair at 100% and detects nothing. The tags come from the generated plan; fixing it means tagging by concept, not by module.",
      "owner": "",
      "raised": "2026-09-01"
    },
    {
      "gap": "`drafted` means the file exists and passes structure and prose checks. No note here is `reviewed`: nobody with the domain has read one, and until that happens none of this is evidence that anything is correct.",
      "owner": "",
      "raised": "2026-09-01"
    },
    {
      "gap": "Two prerequisite edges (null-semantics -> set-operations) were derived while writing rather than taken from the registry, because the plan left both notes with no edge at all and the standard requires at least one. They are recorded in this manifest, not back-written into the registry.",
      "owner": "",
      "raised": "2026-09-01"
    },
    {
      "gap": "The plan gives window-function and cte-vs-subquery no edge at all, so both were derived while writing: window-function builds on grain, cte-vs-subquery builds on window-function. Recorded here rather than back-written into the registry, which has no parent for either key.",
      "owner": "",
      "raised": "2026-09-01"
    },
    {
      "gap": "Seven of the eight analysis-method notes had no edge in the plan, because the registry records a parent only for retention-curve. The reading order used here -- cohort under grain, the bias notes chained after simpson-paradox -- is a teaching sequence chosen while writing, not a dependency the registry asserts.",
      "owner": "",
      "raised": "2026-09-01"
    },
    {
      "gap": "Two tag-overlap warnings remain and both were checked and dismissed: null-semantics against join-semantics share the token 'semantics', survivorship-bias against sampling-bias share 'bias'. Distinct concepts; the overlap is an artefact of splitting slugs into tokens. The validator has no way to record a dismissal, so it is recorded here.",
      "owner": "kina2711",
      "raised": "2026-09-01"
    }
  ],
